{"ref":"passive:mini-engineer","lead":[{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Animated-Impostor_Rina.gif","w":40,"h":53}]},{"k":"p","c":["DLC Content (Emergency Meeting)"]},{"k":"p","c":["This article primarily features content only available in DLC, which may not be available in all copies of the game."]},{"k":"p","c":["Mini Engineer is a passive item from the Emergency Meeting DLC of Vampire Survivors."]},{"k":"p","c":["Mini Engineer is added to the level up item pool after ",{"t":"Lucky Swipe","r":"weapon:lucky-swipe"}," reaches level 2. It is consumed upon Lucky Swipe evolving into ",{"t":"Crossed Wires","r":"weapon:crossed-wires"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Mini Engineer can be found as a stage item on ",{"t":"Polus Replica","r":"stage:polus-replica"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Passive item","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["18 December 2023 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["C1_SHRINK_ENGINE"]]},{"label":"Player stat","cells":[[{"t":"? (edit)","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Mini_Engineer?action=edit"}]]},{"label":"Rarity","cells":[["200"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["3"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[[{"t":"? (edit)","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Mini_Engineer?action=edit"}]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[[{"t":"? (edit)","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Mini_Engineer?action=edit"}]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[[{"t":"? (edit)","x":"https://vampire.survivors.wiki/w/Mini_Engineer?action=edit"}]]},{"label":"Stage item","cells":[["Polus Replica"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"effects","title":"Effects","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Mini Engineer mirrors the effects of ",{"t":"Lightning Ring","r":"weapon:lightning-ring"},", acting as a lesser version of the weapon. It also spawns a miniature, non-functional ",{"t":"Engineer Gino","r":"character:engineer-gino"}," that flies around the player's character. Each Mini Engineer level corresponds to the same level for Lightning Ring."]},{"k":"p","c":["Once it is consumed after evolving Lucky Swipe, the Lightning Ring effect disappears, although the flying Mini Engineer would still remain."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Level"],"h":1},{"c":["Description"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 1"]},{"c":["\"Might occasionally electrocute enemies.\""]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 2"]},{"c":["\"Allegedly offers better moral support.\""]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 3"]},{"c":["\"Allegedly offers better moral support.\""]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"evolutions","title":"Evolutions","blocks":[{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Base weapon"],"h":1},{"c":[],"h":1},{"c":["Passive item"],"h":1},{"c":[],"h":1},{"c":["Evolution"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Lucky_Swipe.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:lucky-swipe"},"\n",{"t":"Lucky Swipe","r":"weapon:lucky-swipe"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":["Max level:\n",{"i":"Sprite-Mini_Engineer.png","w":30,"h":32,"r":"passive:mini-engineer"},"\nMini Engineer"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Crossed_Wires.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:crossed-wires"},"\n",{"t":"Crossed Wires","r":"weapon:crossed-wires"}]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["beta ",{"i":"Steam_logo.svg","w":16,"h":16,"a":"Steam"}," 15 July 2026 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["[QOL] Special passives buff (Operation Guns, Emergency Meeting): can now be found in ArmaDios and as a LevelUp option whenever they'd be normally available, and even if the player has reached the passive limit."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]}]}